  "configuration_id": "config_034",
  "reason": "The best result so far is config_007 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + avgpool + weighted) at 0.706 accuracy. The evidence strongly favors scvi_n200 as RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l as image encoder, and avgpool over transformer. However, the fusion method (weighted vs concat) has only been tested with pca_n2000 (0.635 vs 0.629, a small gap). This experiment tests whether concat fusion is competitive with weighted fusion when paired with the superior scvi_n200 encoder. If concat performs comparably or better, it could reveal a different optimal configuration; if weighted is confirmed superior, it solidifies config_007 as the best and frees the remaining 2 experiments to explore other axes (e.g., singleprofile variants). This is the highest-information single test closest to the current best, making it the best use of experiment 8 with only 2 remaining."
}

